      "id": "F2",
      "statement": "Alert fan_in:A-10859:1794924000000: account A-10859, window 1794924000000 to 1794927600000, 6 senders, 6 transfers, total 204000 (T011431, T011465, T011494, T011536, T011572, T011610). Every contributing transfer has an onward link. The candidate onward-transfer paths are up to 3 onward links long and split in two. One path goes A-10859 > A-78340 > A-75793 > A-92332 (T011583, T011600, T011628). The other goes A-10859 > A-78340 > A-85287 (T011670 or T011583, then T011695). The paths end at A-92332 and A-85287, where this dataset has no further qualifying transfer. Path accounts: A-10859, A-78340, A-75793, A-92332, A-85287. Shared device: D-79802 sent transfers from both A-10859 and A-78340, the alerted account and the next account on the paths. It sent T011583, T011670, T011600 and T011695.",
